  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      487.75,
      286.48,
      595.76
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: The allotment of land called \u201cParagahamulahena\u201d in total extent of about 0.0360 Hectares, depicted as Lot No. 1 in Preliminary Plan No. Maha 6546, dated 18.03.2016, surveyed and prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the village of BanAnga in Meda Siyapattuwa Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Thumpane in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      596.25,
      286.44,
      657.96
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1 - Name of the Land: Paragahamulahena; Name and Address of the claimants: Mr. S. M. M. P. K. Senavirathne, No. 54 A, BanAnga Girihagama, Kumburegama. Extent: 0.0360 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
