  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      658.85,
      286.46,
      723.43
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries: North: Paragahamulahena claimed by S. M. M. P. K. Senavirthne; East: Paragahamulahena claimed by S. M. M. P. K. Senavirthne and Road (Pradesiya Sabha); South: Road (Pradesiya Sabha); West: Road (Pradesiya Sabha).",
