      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.16,
      539.38,
      471.2
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, at the Thumpane on the 24th November day of 2016 at 09.30 a.m and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 03 rd day of November 2016, the nature of their interests in the Land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
